  abilityDesc: 20 combo Earth attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    3 turns Atk, Def reduction infliction, 100% DoT reduction for 3 turns, boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 3 turns, fills BB gauge to max & boosts Earth
    elemental damage for 3 turns
